{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/sentsdk\/senttimelineevent\/isprovisional"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/sentsdk\/senttimelineevent\/isprovisional"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Indicates whether the event is provisional."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK","doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTTimelineEvent"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTTimelineEvent\/isProvisional","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SENTSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"isProvisional"}],"title":"isProvisional","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isProvisional"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)SENTTimelineEvent(py)isProvisional"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isProvisional"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A provisional event is identified based on real-time detections, but may change in the near"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"future as more data is collected and processed, to filter out unwanted artifacts. For"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"example, a provisional car transport may get identified, followed by a provisional bus"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transport. After the full trip is complete, these provisional events may get merged into"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a single final car event."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Final events are generated independently of the provisional events, and have unique"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event IDs. They are not linked to the provisional events they may resemble, replace,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or overlap with."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Currently, provisional events apply to transport types and to off-the-grid events whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reasons are compatible with flight detection. A provisional off-the-grid event keeps the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"current processing window open because it may later be replaced by a flight."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Until that window concludes, clients that exclude provisional events will not receive a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"final off-the-grid event, and the preceding stationary event will remain ongoing."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://com.sentiance.SENTSDK/documentation/SENTSDK/SENTTimelineEvent/isProvisional":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Indicates whether the event is provisional."}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isProvisional","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"isProvisional","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/